    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to bring to the market 50 Ashfield Rise. \r\n\r\nThis three-bedroom, two-bathroom semi-detached home offers spacious accommodation throughout, with a good-sized rear garden, covered outdoor entertaining area and versatile garden room.\r\n\r\nThe property is approached via a composite front door, leading into the entrance and through to the living room, which features a fireplace as a focal point. Double doors lead through to the dining and kitchen area. The fully fitted kitchen includes a central island, providing a practical space for cooking, dining and entertaining. A downstairs WC completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three generous bedrooms and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the garden includes a covered area, providing a useful space for outdoor entertaining. There is also a separate garden room, offering flexible additional space that could be used as a home office, study, gym or hobby room.\r\n\r\nTo the front, there is a driveway providing off-street parking, with side access leading to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned living accommodation together with useful additional outdoor space and excellent potential for a new owner to make it their own.\r\n\r\nThe property is situated in the much sought-after Ashfield development in the seaside town of Balbriggan. Ideally located, the property is within easy reach of Balbriggan Town Centre, offering a wide range of shops, schools, restaurants and local amenities.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by public transport, with Dublin Bus and Bus Éireann services available close to the development, as well as Balbriggan Train Station providing suburban rail access to Dublin City Centre, with journey times of approximately 45 minutes. The beautiful Balbriggan Beach is also within easy reach, making this an appealing location for all."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious accommodation throughout\r\n\r\nOff street parking to the front\r\n\r\nGarden room offering additional space\r\n\r\nFully fitted kitchen with central island\r\n\r\nIdeally located within easy reach of Balbriggan Town Centre\r\n\r\nClose to public transport links"
      },
